{"metadata":{"roleHeading":"API Collection","modules":[{"name":"Theme Orange"}],"role":"collectionGroup","title":"TokensProvider Implementations"},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeIconComponentTokensProvider\/checkInstances(count:for:)"],"anchor":"Instance-Methods"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeIconComponentTokensProvider"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeIconComponentTokensProvider\/TokensProvider-Implementations","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemeiconcomponenttokensprovider\/tokensprovider-implementations"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"sections":[],"kind":"article","references":{"ic_theme_orange.png":{"alt":null,"type":"image","identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesOrange\/ic_theme_orange.png","traits":["1x","light"]}]},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeIconComponentTokensProvider":{"title":"OrangeThemeIconComponentTokensProvider","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemeiconcomponenttokensprovider","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeIconComponentTokensProvider","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OrangeThemeIconComponentTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OrangeThemeIconComponentTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A class which wraps all "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"component  tokens of icons"}]},{"type":"text","text":" for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"icons"}]},{"type":"text","text":" used in some components like "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTag"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Contains also references to semantic tokens providers so as to be able to use them to define the component tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This provider should be integrated as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllIconComponentTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation inside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"all tokens to the users. It helps users to override some of the tokens and assign them to an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation to use."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Custom themes can use subclass of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeIconComponentTokensProvider","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and apply the provider they need."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It implements also the protocol "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IconomponentTokens"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to expose the component tokens for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"icons"}]},{"type":"text","text":" through any "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Icons"}]},{"type":"text","text":" components tokens are defined with raw and semantic tokens of colors (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllColorSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","title":"Theme Orange","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The Orange theme overrides some tokens from the basic "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" and should be seen as the default theme for the OUDS library with the Orange brand colors for example."}],"images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png"}],"role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange","type":"topic"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeIconComponentTokensProvider/checkInstances(count:for:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeIconComponentTokensProvider\/checkInstances(count:for:)","title":"checkInstances(count:for:)","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"checkInstances"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"count"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"for"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemeiconcomponenttokensprovider\/checkinstances(count:for:)","type":"topic"}}}